% Ground abstraction of gk_gemini.js for the reference tool, written by hand from the
% extracted clauses. The tool declines the extraction, which has Skolem functions.
% susp = the suspension at .8434; cap = the permission, a default at .96;
% the strict clause opposes cap for a member with a suspended membership.
member.
0.8434::susp.
0.96::cap :- member, unless(-cap, 1).
-cap :- member, susp.
query(cap).
